  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM 2021 - Building Inclusive and Peaceful Communities in BARMM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in Bangsamoro contribute to more inclusive and peacefuli communities through participation in socio-economic affairs. The project partners with women cooperatives of former combatants and members of the Moro Islamic Liberation Front&apos;s Bangsamoro Islamic Women&apos;s Auxiliary Brigade (BIWAB).</narrative>
  </description>
